Package: tinycensus
Title: Lightweight Interface to the US Census API
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Christopher T.",
           family = "Kenny",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "christopherkenny@fas.harvard.edu",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9386-6860"))
Description: Download data from the United States Census Bureau API 
    <https://www.census.gov/data/developers/data-sets.html>. Functions
    support major surveys, including the American Community Survey and the
    decennial census. Data is formatted in a tidy way, where each observation 
    is a geographic unit. Geometry data for a geography is available automatically
    joined with 'tinytiger'.
